      {
        "author_name": "uchiha kuma",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102559699372494843044/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUF7oHGVrERAg0drxb2TCPX9OWQZOMgSgsqcahXI-6q-6yTJV4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Good day nice people,\nI have some recently indirect experience with this firm.\nTheir inspection is very thorough. However I want to share some thoughts about this industry in general not specifically with this firm.\n\nI recently bought a used car and a week later I had to send it in for some repairs. I am totally ok with it because I know used car is not brand new they are meant to have problems here and there.\n\nSame logic for houses, unless you are buying brand new, there are and will always be, issues/problems/concerns/non-compliances here and there as it is not brand new. Even if it is brand new there are still \"problems\" unless in a perfect world you have the inspection firm build a house as per their \"perfection\" code, then the house will be \"perfect\". but if you have another firm inspect it , it will be problematic again.\n\nSo all I am trying to say is, if you look at something you like , used car, 2nd hand houses, things on marketplace etc., accept the imperfection because we are not in a perfect world.\nwhat is important is ,\nis this what you want?\nis this better than what you have?\nif yes, then go for it.\nif not, then keep looking.\nif you are not sure about it, maybe yes or maybe no,\nthen that is a No. keep looking.\n\nHappy March break!",
        "time": 1709734620,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alain Martineau",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103832756480604035171/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJSyYkzu8F64RFIi3eH1gRklyrWe4-IV3CdBLm7aH3jzdf0b5lO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "This is the second time I've used this company for a pre-purchase condo inspection. The work is done very professionally, and they take the time to explain the situation and legal obligations, all with a very comprehensive report and at a very competitive price. I wholeheartedly recommend Charles-Alexandre for your inspections; it's not worth skipping them and taking unnecessary risks.",
        "time": 1769471373,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ju Ann",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101953534665713829045/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLjr3fi3g5xiV_FEOWGeIDYdvpyFGwtBMCPq89p_d9S3xCAsA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I was very impressed by the quality of work Charles provided during the pre-purchase inspection. Charles carried out an extremely thorough job and was very available throughout the entire process.\n\nHe identified issues that hadn't been mentioned in the other reports provided by the seller.\n\nExemplary work, accompanied by relevant advice and clear explanations. I highly recommend his services and wouldn't hesitate to use his services again for future projects.\n\nJulie",
        "time": 1736841767,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Imene Beni",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106918458109247142512/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrM-yj22DUfZSecHUFP6liVt3mZC3GAsxvYLaHgHXSGaEcNw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We had two inspections done with Charle and we are very satisfied! He is attentive to his clients' needs and takes the time to explain everything during the inspection, as well as answering our questions and addressing our concerns. A complete and detailed report was provided promptly after the inspection.\nThank you very much for this excellent service!",
        "time": 1710539478,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie-Ève Perreault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114713775106967640877/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW4GARZt13XcD7hHwyE7Ble3K53T9azsJ8winhX7uh_G6xiEDyR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
